IV + V     => IX
M - I      => CMXCIX
X / II     => V
XI * VI    => LXVI
VII ** III => CCCXLIII
V - V      => nulla (they didn't have a symbol for 0)
V / II     => non potest (they didn't do fractions)
MMM + M    => non potest (they only went up to 3999)
V - X      => non potest (no negative numbers)
X - V      => V
